MID_SE_Fab_Hal_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_C_001: {SetColor=Gray}Look at this herd! Being among these animals is\nso unpleasant.{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_C_002: Creepy, tall... I wonder if that's Fabio!
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_C_003: {SetColor=Gray}I believe I recognize that girl. She travels with the\none I seek. I will question her.{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_C_004: {SetColor=Gray}I am certain I have divined the truth, but this is\ntoo good an opportunity to check my hypothesis.{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_C_005: {SetColor=Gray}He was the skeevy person Toli and the rest were\nsuspicious of...{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_C_006: What a coincidence! Neither of us is with\nour companions.
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_C_007: Um, uh, yes? I, uh...
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_C_008: Please, feel at ease. I simply wish a friendly chat.
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_C_009: {SetColor=Gray}Just wants to speak with me? Maybe what he really\nwants is to preach at me... That's not scary, I guess.{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_C_010: Hmm? Did you say something? You seem uneasy.
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_C_011: You're way too close! And way too scary! I don't\nwanna talk to you!
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_C_012: I understand that this body is an imposing one. But\nto upbraid me for it is quite unfair.
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_C_013: You're scarier than you realize... Anyway, isn't it\nhard to preach to people when you loom over them?
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_C_014: {SetColor=Gray}Hm. It seems you have heard little of my nature, or\nof Vritra.{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_C_015: {SetColor=Gray}Perhaps you simply did not understand it. If so, you\nlikely know little of Kunlun.{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_C_016: Yet if we become friendly, you may intercede on my\nbehalf with your companions. A plan emerges.
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_C_017: Seems like you really want to befriend Anatolia...
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_C_018: Maybe you want to teach people who dislike the\ntemple about other deities or something.
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_C_019: Close to the mark! I find your way of thinking\nquite original.
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_C_020: Gotcha. Well, your mission must not be going so well\nif I'm your last resort.
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_C_021: Anyway, to start, if you wanna make friends,\nyou need to put on a smile!
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_C_022: I somehow doubt that would improve my fortunes\nwith Anatolia.
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_C_023: It might! When I was in a troupe, we'd get some odd\nlooks whenever we visited foreign lands.
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_C_024: But as soon as we all started smiling and being\nfriendly, poof! Everyone warmed up to us!
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_C_025: You should give it a shot. Just don't do that one\nsuper creepy smile you normally do.
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_C_026: {SetColor=Gray}Judging by appearances is the shallow sort of\nthinking endemic to these beasts.{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_C_027: {SetColor=Gray}Still, if it is an effective strategy to ingratiate myself...\nIt is simple enough. I shall put it to the test forthwith.{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_C_028: Ah! That's just as bad as before! It's...not natural.\nYou gotta soften your expression...
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_C_029: This body's facial muscles may have become rigid\nas they've degraded. Let's try this...
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_C_030: Your expression is quite...quizzical. Is it intended to\nbait me into a smile? A laugh?
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_C_031: S-somebody...heeelp!
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_C_032: What a coward! I fear she may never overcome that\nweakness of spirit.
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_B: <EDH>
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_B_001: {SetColor=Gray}Hmm...what's this? Something is not quite right here.{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_B_002: Um, I know I said I'd apologize for those kids, but\nwhy did you bring me here to do it?
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_B_003: We gotta make sure you're genuinely sorry. I bet\nyou've got more money than they did, don'tcha?
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_B_004: Money? I mean...weren't you the ones who bumped\ninto them first, anyway? Eep.
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_B_005: {SetColor=Gray}Ah. The situation has become clear. Their behavior\nis sadly typical the world over.{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_B_006: {SetColor=Gray}She should act in accordance with her own\nweakness. Look at her tremble! Hm?{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_B_007: {SetColor=Gray}I can't run fast enough to get away from them... But I\ndon't want to give up my money... I know!{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_B_008: OK! To apologize, allow me to dazzle you. I will show\nyou a miracle that surpasses mere gold!
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_B_009: See here this ball. This is an ordinary ball—nothing\nmagical or strange about it.
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_B_010: Watch closely now! I'm holding it in my right hand.\nThree, two, one...zero!
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_B_011: As you can see, the ball has vanished! And in its\nplace...three balls in my left hand!
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_B_012: {SetColor=Gray}She has shaken off her nervousness, as though it\nnever was. Impressive. But what will she do now?{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_B_013: Thank you for watching! Well then, I'll just head off\non my way now. Unless, er...
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_B_014: Yeah, you're not goin' anywhere. We could make\na lot of money off these performances of yours.
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_B_015: Awww, come on... Let me go! Please? Please!
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_B_016: {SetColor=Gray}And there it is. Well, I suppose I do owe her for the\nshow.{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_B_017: Huh? Yaaah!
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_B_018: You may not have liked her performance, but as an\nacquaintance of hers, I apologize on her behalf.
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_B_019: Further, I shall demonstrate spirit magic the likes of\nwhich you have never seen. It will be memorable.
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_B_020: Thank you so much! I don't know what would've\nhappened if you hadn't shown up...
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_B_021: If I were to let you come to harm when I could\nprevent it, Kunlun would not forgive me easily.
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_B_022: I was also quite taken with your ability to rouse your\nspirits and overcome your fright.
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_B_023: Um, are you complimenting me or something? I guess\nyou're not so scary after all...
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_B_024: You looked freaky when you took those guys out,\nbut your smile now actually looks...normal.
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_B_025: And also, what was that mysterious spirit magic,\nhuh?! Teach me! We could be a double act!
MID_SE_Fab_Hal_B_026: Hardly. It is not to be used to entertain beasts. They\nare troublesome and tend to become too familiar.